WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.230
Everyone here...

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:03.740
We're going to make peace!

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:12.990
Did you just say "peace"?

00:00:12.990 --> 00:00:14.110
I did!

00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:21.440
H-Hey!

00:00:21.440 --> 00:00:23.620
Hey! She's mine. Darn it!

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:25.120
Sally!

00:00:26.020 --> 00:00:29.060
Peace between ogres and humans?

00:00:29.060 --> 00:00:32.630
What an ignorant little child you are.

00:00:32.910 --> 00:00:33.780
Huh?

00:00:34.170 --> 00:00:37.850
Are you saying ogres and humans 
can never live in peace?

00:00:38.560 --> 00:00:42.630
Don't you know what ogres are made of?

00:00:43.390 --> 00:00:45.190
Hatred!

00:00:46.270 --> 00:00:52.780
It is said that ogres are made 
of human hatred.

00:00:55.430 --> 00:00:57.030
What are you talking about?

00:00:57.030 --> 00:01:00.280
Exactly what it sounds like.

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:06.700
Our creator captures your hatred 
within a vessel.

00:01:06.700 --> 00:01:09.340
And that vessel is called an ogre.

00:01:09.340 --> 00:01:11.460
Do you see?

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:17.040
We were created 
to have an innate hatred of humans!

00:01:17.910 --> 00:01:20.010
There can be no peace.

00:01:20.480 --> 00:01:22.320
There must not be!

00:01:22.320 --> 00:01:24.370
Never!

00:02:56.040 --> 00:03:00.530
Resolutions and Goodbyes

00:02:58.900 --> 00:03:00.530
But if we talk,

00:03:00.860 --> 00:03:03.530
we might at least achieve 
a little understanding!

00:03:04.790 --> 00:03:10.790
You truly are an ignorant little human.

00:03:17.500 --> 00:03:18.430
Sally!

00:03:21.510 --> 00:03:27.310
The thought of achieving understanding 
with humans makes me sick!

00:03:27.310 --> 00:03:29.600
Pathetic creature!

00:03:31.550 --> 00:03:33.290
Can you keep spouting your delusions

00:03:33.290 --> 00:03:36.370
after I rip you limb from limb?

00:03:36.370 --> 00:03:37.900
Ridiculous human!

00:03:38.130 --> 00:03:38.920
Sally!

00:03:38.920 --> 00:03:40.400
Hey, bunny!

00:03:40.850 --> 00:03:43.280
I guess you'll do as an opponent for now.

00:03:44.300 --> 00:03:48.520
Play along while I kill time, would you?

00:03:53.420 --> 00:03:55.740
Damnation. I was too careless.

00:03:55.740 --> 00:03:57.710
Oh, it's alive?

00:03:57.710 --> 00:03:59.580
He's a mask ogre.

00:03:59.580 --> 00:04:02.050
That mask is his true form.

00:04:02.540 --> 00:04:04.140
Oh, is it?

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:06.620
In that case...

00:04:06.620 --> 00:04:08.930
H-Hey! Why did you tell him?!

00:04:09.340 --> 00:04:10.680
Now, now.

00:04:10.680 --> 00:04:13.520
Could I ask you to refrain, 
for my sake?

00:04:14.920 --> 00:04:16.690
<i>When did he...</i>

00:04:16.690 --> 00:04:19.920
I'll be getting an earful 
if you kill him.

00:04:19.920 --> 00:04:22.840
You're no ordinary ogre.

00:04:23.830 --> 00:04:26.070
What do they call you?

00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:30.080
I know it might surprise you,

00:04:30.330 --> 00:04:32.460
but I'm known as Sumeragi.

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:37.880
You're <i>that</i> Sumeragi?

00:04:41.370 --> 00:04:43.810
Well, look at you.

00:04:43.810 --> 00:04:46.640
Just so you know, 
engagement in blood sport is...

00:04:51.650 --> 00:04:54.100
not my preference.

00:04:55.180 --> 00:04:58.090
That's not a very ogre-like thing to say.

00:04:58.440 --> 00:04:59.980
Indeed.

00:04:59.980 --> 00:05:03.400
But I could say something similar 
about you, could I not?

00:05:03.690 --> 00:05:07.450
The savagery to attack another unprovoked...

00:05:07.450 --> 00:05:10.100
It's hardly what one would call "human."

00:05:10.530 --> 00:05:14.120
And that's exactly why I wanted to meet you.

00:05:15.360 --> 00:05:16.340
Sally!

00:05:16.340 --> 00:05:17.320
Archers!

00:05:17.320 --> 00:05:18.790
Prepare the flaming arrows!

00:05:19.800 --> 00:05:21.100
Humans...

00:05:22.840 --> 00:05:23.900
Ogres...

00:05:24.210 --> 00:05:25.330
Demihumans...

00:05:25.640 --> 00:05:27.790
I want to find compromise between them.

00:05:28.520 --> 00:05:31.620
I decided that would be the point 
of my journey.

00:05:32.850 --> 00:05:33.930
Which means...

00:05:37.870 --> 00:05:41.690
I can't let hatred be the death of me!

00:05:43.350 --> 00:05:46.320
You... Your eye...

00:05:48.820 --> 00:05:50.070
Let go!

00:05:59.330 --> 00:06:02.340
Sally, can you hear me?

00:06:05.050 --> 00:06:06.140
Don't worry.

00:06:06.600 --> 00:06:09.590
I'm in control this time.

00:06:10.060 --> 00:06:11.470
I'm glad.

00:06:13.450 --> 00:06:16.700
You're finally aware of your power?

00:06:16.700 --> 00:06:17.520
Yeah.

00:06:17.850 --> 00:06:20.730
Is this what Frau was talking about?

00:06:21.030 --> 00:06:26.470
But I feel hot all over, 
and my mind keeps going blank.

00:06:26.470 --> 00:06:27.370
Hang in there!

00:06:27.370 --> 00:06:28.740
It's still a fight!

00:06:30.200 --> 00:06:31.480
A fight...

00:06:32.740 --> 00:06:35.420
Yeah, that's right...

00:06:35.420 --> 00:06:37.300
What's with her eye?

00:06:38.090 --> 00:06:41.250
An ogre and... an ogre...

00:06:42.870 --> 00:06:46.000
This thing is an ogre...

00:06:45.990 --> 00:06:49.270
For some reason... I just want to...

00:06:49.270 --> 00:06:50.940
To kill her?

00:06:51.390 --> 00:06:53.420
N-Never!

00:06:53.420 --> 00:06:56.770
There is no need to hide it...

00:06:57.340 --> 00:07:02.150
It's a natural urge, 
for those with your power.

00:07:02.580 --> 00:07:04.710
You know about my power?

00:07:04.710 --> 00:07:06.160
What's this, now?

00:07:06.160 --> 00:07:09.150
You've been wielding it 
<i>without</i> knowing?

00:07:09.700 --> 00:07:12.820
Let me finish what I was saying before.

00:07:13.390 --> 00:07:16.440
Ogres are made out of hatred.

00:07:16.880 --> 00:07:23.360
But your power is made of 
its opposing force!

00:07:23.360 --> 00:07:24.790
"Opposing"...

00:07:24.790 --> 00:07:26.050
Yes.

00:07:26.630 --> 00:07:32.800
A dangerous thing 
that could destroy all ogres...

00:07:32.800 --> 00:07:35.140
That's what you are!

00:07:36.050 --> 00:07:40.850
You talk of peace and compromise,

00:07:41.190 --> 00:07:44.560
but it's impossible.

00:07:44.870 --> 00:07:50.570
Your very existence is a threat to ogrekind!

00:07:50.940 --> 00:07:55.070
If you truly wish to unite human and ogre,

00:07:55.360 --> 00:07:57.540
you should kill yourself now!

00:07:58.580 --> 00:08:00.330
Stop that now!

00:08:00.980 --> 00:08:04.090
Sally, you don't have to believe 
the things he says.

00:08:05.630 --> 00:08:10.340
He's just acting out of desperation, 
because he's afraid of your power.

00:08:11.860 --> 00:08:12.680
But...

00:08:13.340 --> 00:08:18.100
Do I really have the power 
to destroy ogres?

00:08:19.650 --> 00:08:21.020
You do.

00:08:22.160 --> 00:08:23.140
I see.

00:08:26.160 --> 00:08:27.230
I understand.

00:08:29.410 --> 00:08:30.630
Hey, tree ogre!

00:08:30.630 --> 00:08:31.780
Hair ogre!

00:08:32.090 --> 00:08:35.610
Earlier, I proposed peace negotiations.

00:08:35.610 --> 00:08:38.230
Sorry, but I'm taking it back!

00:08:39.110 --> 00:08:40.240
Princess's orders...

00:08:40.470 --> 00:08:42.670
Yes, these are orders indeed.

00:08:43.160 --> 00:08:48.400
Make peace, or I'll kill you both!

00:08:54.260 --> 00:08:59.220
There's a proposal I'd like you, 
as an enemy to all ogres, to hear.

00:08:59.630 --> 00:09:01.140
What is it?

00:09:02.640 --> 00:09:04.810
It regards peace between ogres and humans,

00:09:04.810 --> 00:09:07.650
and a path to coexistence!

00:09:09.820 --> 00:09:12.940
What's this? 
You're threatening us now?

00:09:12.940 --> 00:09:14.320
Yes!

00:09:14.700 --> 00:09:17.390
I'd prefer to negotiate if we could.

00:09:17.870 --> 00:09:19.070
But,

00:09:19.530 --> 00:09:21.160
this journey has taught me

00:09:21.980 --> 00:09:25.680
there are many more things 
you can't resolve with words alone!

00:09:26.440 --> 00:09:27.330
And so...

00:09:28.090 --> 00:09:28.960
What can I do?

00:09:29.250 --> 00:09:30.340
Princess's orders!

00:09:44.430 --> 00:09:45.850
Make yourselves at home.

00:09:46.900 --> 00:09:47.850
Lady Winnie!

00:09:47.980 --> 00:09:50.480
I've decided on a purpose for my journey!

00:09:50.480 --> 00:09:54.030
Mikoto! I really hate prejudice!

00:09:54.420 --> 00:09:55.990
I <i>really</i> hate it!

00:09:57.710 --> 00:10:01.620
So you're going to travel around 
and preach anti-discrimination?

00:10:02.310 --> 00:10:05.370
No. That wouldn't do any good.

00:10:05.880 --> 00:10:09.120
But... I want to create 
at least a little compromise!

00:10:10.170 --> 00:10:12.530
I think I want that 
to be the purpose of my journey!

00:10:14.200 --> 00:10:16.380
<i>I made up my mind to keep going.</i>

00:10:17.110 --> 00:10:20.390
So if I have this power, 
I'm going to use it!

00:10:20.390 --> 00:10:25.390
I'm tired of your posturing!

00:10:29.270 --> 00:10:30.130
Sally!

00:10:30.130 --> 00:10:31.540
I'm all right, Frau.

00:10:32.090 --> 00:10:34.540
Just leave this to me.

00:10:34.540 --> 00:10:36.280
Well, aren't you confident?

00:10:36.280 --> 00:10:40.280
A word of warning: 
My hair is harder than steel wire!

00:10:43.280 --> 00:10:44.760
Wh-What?!

00:10:45.950 --> 00:10:47.290
My hair...

00:10:59.820 --> 00:11:01.790
Was that a laugh?

00:11:01.790 --> 00:11:03.120
Did you enjoy that?

00:11:03.120 --> 00:11:05.600
N-No! Not at all!

00:11:05.600 --> 00:11:08.090
Don't bother hiding it.

00:11:08.090 --> 00:11:14.650
I, too, once strode among humankind, 
and I killed and ate them.

00:11:14.650 --> 00:11:16.860
I enjoyed it so!

00:11:17.330 --> 00:11:19.110
I'm nothing like you.

00:11:19.410 --> 00:11:21.360
Ah, but you are.

00:11:21.820 --> 00:11:26.270
Now it's time for some fun of my own.

00:11:26.270 --> 00:11:28.870
Let's have a little blood sport!

00:11:29.160 --> 00:11:31.520
But first...

00:11:31.520 --> 00:11:35.110
Finish off that little waste of space!

00:11:36.110 --> 00:11:38.550
Her presence annoys me.

00:11:38.550 --> 00:11:39.760
Old man...

00:11:40.010 --> 00:11:41.060
What are you talking about?

00:11:41.060 --> 00:11:42.420
She's your companion!

00:11:42.420 --> 00:11:44.510
She may be the same species,

00:11:44.510 --> 00:11:47.140
but we're not companions!

00:11:47.540 --> 00:11:51.080
A low ogre that collapses 
after one strike...

00:11:51.080 --> 00:11:54.070
She's nothing but a tool for me to exploit.

00:11:54.070 --> 00:11:56.220
I'm a mid ogre, actually.

00:11:56.220 --> 00:11:59.150
If only I had a proper horn...

00:11:59.150 --> 00:12:02.340
I don't care about your rank!

00:12:02.340 --> 00:12:08.250
It wasn't your own power 
that awakened me, was it?

00:12:08.250 --> 00:12:11.160
Which means you've served your purpose.

00:12:11.700 --> 00:12:15.850
If you're just going to embarrass yourself, 
you're better off dead!

00:12:17.080 --> 00:12:19.340
Pathetic creature!

00:12:25.590 --> 00:12:27.020
I see now.

00:12:27.020 --> 00:12:30.830
I can't achieve understanding with you.

00:12:30.830 --> 00:12:32.810
And I know what my power is for.

00:12:32.810 --> 00:12:35.480
It's meant to be used 
on creatures like you!

00:12:59.040 --> 00:13:03.760
C-Curse you... impudent creature...

00:13:04.400 --> 00:13:06.510
The peach eye...

00:13:06.820 --> 00:13:10.240
Hideous purifying thing...

00:13:18.260 --> 00:13:19.450
Sally!

00:13:19.450 --> 00:13:20.900
I'm exhausted.

00:13:21.960 --> 00:13:23.030
But...

00:13:26.030 --> 00:13:27.500
Yes, Sally.

00:13:27.500 --> 00:13:29.580
You did well.

00:13:29.580 --> 00:13:32.900
You protected us and the forest.

00:13:32.900 --> 00:13:33.910
She's right.

00:13:34.450 --> 00:13:38.040
Without you, we'd all be dead.

00:13:39.720 --> 00:13:40.870
Thank you!

00:13:43.320 --> 00:13:44.720
Hey, elves!

00:13:44.720 --> 00:13:46.800
You'd better do this right, too!

00:13:48.370 --> 00:13:49.500
Indeed.

00:13:49.500 --> 00:13:52.310
You did save us in our time of peril.

00:13:52.710 --> 00:13:54.460
Human girl...

00:13:54.460 --> 00:13:57.740
I offer you thanks, on behalf of the elves.

00:13:57.740 --> 00:13:59.900
Pompous as ever!

00:13:59.900 --> 00:14:02.070
And you're far too informal!

00:14:02.550 --> 00:14:05.420
Really, no need to thank me...

00:14:05.420 --> 00:14:07.020
Just get along, okay?

00:14:08.340 --> 00:14:09.390
Winnie...

00:14:09.390 --> 00:14:10.320
Yes?

00:14:10.940 --> 00:14:12.820
I'm really exhausted.

00:14:13.240 --> 00:14:14.830
Can I rest?

00:14:15.180 --> 00:14:16.940
Yes, you may.

00:14:18.090 --> 00:14:19.230
You did well.

00:14:23.970 --> 00:14:26.040
What's wrong, Hawthorn?

00:14:27.310 --> 00:14:29.470
The hair ogre's gone.

00:14:43.260 --> 00:14:45.030
Hey, bring more booze!

00:14:53.610 --> 00:14:54.470
Oh?

00:14:55.900 --> 00:14:59.560
<i>Sumeragi... 
You were closer than I thought.</i>

00:14:59.560 --> 00:15:00.840
Indeed.

00:15:00.840 --> 00:15:03.380
Thank you for checking in promptly.

00:15:03.710 --> 00:15:07.290
Now, how did the battle with Juki go?

00:15:07.620 --> 00:15:10.680
Did you notice a change 
in that human?

00:15:11.090 --> 00:15:12.140
<i>I knew it.</i>

00:15:12.450 --> 00:15:18.140
You're the one who sent Hatsuki 
to revive Juki.

00:15:18.140 --> 00:15:20.910
<i>Sumeragi. What are you after?</i>

00:15:21.220 --> 00:15:22.260
Meki.

00:15:22.900 --> 00:15:27.040
Tell me about the human at once!

00:15:28.290 --> 00:15:30.540
It's what I want to know.

00:15:30.540 --> 00:15:32.850
We can chat about other matters later.

00:15:33.740 --> 00:15:36.920
<i>Why is he so obsessed with her?</i>

00:15:37.640 --> 00:15:38.760
Meki?

00:15:38.760 --> 00:15:42.790
W-Well... 
After we ran into Hatsuki...

00:15:44.360 --> 00:15:46.420
Ah, I see.

00:15:46.640 --> 00:15:50.090
It was worth sending Juki after all, then.

00:15:51.220 --> 00:15:52.430
Well done.

00:15:52.900 --> 00:15:54.070
Now, Meki.

00:15:54.070 --> 00:15:56.430
Shall we continue our conversation 
from before?

00:15:56.430 --> 00:15:59.410
<i>Actually... first...</i>

00:16:01.270 --> 00:16:04.230
<i>What is that thing 
that looks like Somenki?</i>

00:16:04.230 --> 00:16:06.720
I'm not a thing! I <i>am</i> him!

00:16:06.720 --> 00:16:08.050
Oh, this?

00:16:08.050 --> 00:16:10.610
The monster hunter cut off his head.

00:16:10.610 --> 00:16:12.740
I got careless! 
That's the only reason!

00:16:12.740 --> 00:16:14.040
Monster hunter?

00:16:14.040 --> 00:16:15.220
That's right...

00:16:15.220 --> 00:16:17.200
He got you, as well, didn't he?

00:16:17.450 --> 00:16:20.900
<i>Sumeragi... How did you survive?</i>

00:16:20.900 --> 00:16:25.730
Well... Let's just say 
we successfully talked it out.

00:16:26.290 --> 00:16:27.840
<i>You and the monster hunter?</i>

00:16:28.090 --> 00:16:30.460
<i>What in the world did you talk about?</i>

00:16:30.890 --> 00:16:34.970
The potential of the girl 
you're monitoring.

00:16:35.720 --> 00:16:36.920
Sally...

00:16:41.860 --> 00:16:43.390
I'm surprised.

00:16:43.390 --> 00:16:44.790
About what?

00:16:44.790 --> 00:16:47.310
That you trusted an ogre...

00:16:47.310 --> 00:16:51.570
And a damned suspicious one, at that.

00:16:53.170 --> 00:16:58.450
Never trust anyone 
who's always smiling like that.

00:17:01.910 --> 00:17:04.580
I guess that includes you.

00:17:04.850 --> 00:17:08.760
I don't trust that ogre.

00:17:08.760 --> 00:17:11.090
Rather, I trust Sally.

00:17:12.330 --> 00:17:13.630
What do you mean?

00:17:19.220 --> 00:17:22.330
Oh, I fell asleep.

00:17:24.700 --> 00:17:26.480
I can barely move!

00:17:32.470 --> 00:17:34.240
Oh, welcome!

00:17:34.500 --> 00:17:35.940
Morning, Berett.

00:17:35.940 --> 00:17:37.330
Can I have a juice?

00:17:37.330 --> 00:17:37.990
Yes!

00:17:37.990 --> 00:17:39.130
Hey!

00:17:39.610 --> 00:17:41.760
You slept the whole day, eh?

00:17:42.120 --> 00:17:43.470
Understandable.

00:17:43.470 --> 00:17:44.750
How are you feeling?

00:17:46.330 --> 00:17:47.620
A demihuman...

00:17:47.910 --> 00:17:49.250
a human...

00:17:49.640 --> 00:17:50.880
and an elf...

00:17:51.210 --> 00:17:53.800
All chatting around the same table!

00:17:53.800 --> 00:17:55.630
Chatting?

00:17:56.260 --> 00:17:57.920
They're showing me 
how to get through the forest,

00:17:57.920 --> 00:17:59.730
and what lies beyond.

00:18:01.260 --> 00:18:04.320
He's quite sharp for a human.

00:18:04.320 --> 00:18:06.940
Much smarter than these reptiles.

00:18:06.940 --> 00:18:09.520
What was that, long-ears?!

00:18:09.520 --> 00:18:12.710
All you know is the forest, anyway!

00:18:12.710 --> 00:18:16.530
It's your kind that knows nothing 
beyond the region!

00:18:16.920 --> 00:18:18.810
<i>They bicker,</i>

00:18:18.810 --> 00:18:23.200
<i>but with none of the hostility 
that I saw before.</i>

00:18:24.110 --> 00:18:27.610
<i>I think this is what I'm trying to achieve.</i>

00:18:28.540 --> 00:18:32.290
Don't forget this sight, or this feeling.

00:18:32.290 --> 00:18:33.810
Winnie?!

00:18:33.810 --> 00:18:38.300
I think that will nourish you 
on your journey ahead.

00:18:39.250 --> 00:18:40.300
Right!

00:18:40.920 --> 00:18:43.430
Then, is it safe to proceed?

00:18:44.650 --> 00:18:48.480
They've been annoying me 
for quite a while now.

00:18:48.480 --> 00:18:50.420
What are you doing, witch?!

00:18:50.420 --> 00:18:51.700
Here you are!

00:18:51.700 --> 00:18:52.800
Thanks!

00:18:52.800 --> 00:18:55.960
Berett, you look so cute in that apron!

00:18:55.960 --> 00:18:57.790
Hey, Sally!

00:18:57.790 --> 00:18:59.420
Stop her!

00:19:00.470 --> 00:19:02.400
Hawthorn got burned?

00:19:02.400 --> 00:19:04.000
Medium rare, I'd say.

00:19:04.850 --> 00:19:07.410
So, Sally, what are your plans?

00:19:08.150 --> 00:19:09.830
I'm going to get back to my journey.

00:19:10.130 --> 00:19:12.070
I know that.

00:19:12.070 --> 00:19:14.320
But you're not leaving right away, are you?

00:19:14.740 --> 00:19:18.970
The elves and the lizardfolk 
wanted to host you.

00:19:20.450 --> 00:19:22.350
And you want to learn magic, don't you?

00:19:22.350 --> 00:19:23.390
Why not stay?

00:19:23.900 --> 00:19:24.850
No...

00:19:25.280 --> 00:19:28.600
I have to leave right away.

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:31.240
Why?

00:19:31.240 --> 00:19:32.630
That's awfully sudden.

00:19:33.420 --> 00:19:34.480
Yeah.

00:19:34.830 --> 00:19:39.740
I think I probably shouldn't stay 
in one place for too long.

00:19:40.390 --> 00:19:43.820
I seem to meet ogres wherever I go.

00:19:44.630 --> 00:19:48.010
That chicken one 
was probably a chance encounter,

00:19:48.670 --> 00:19:52.030
and Carrot and the walrus 
might also have been a coincidence...

00:19:52.570 --> 00:19:56.490
But I don't think that masked one was.

00:19:57.560 --> 00:20:02.010
And the hair ogre, 
and the tree ogre that she awakened...

00:20:02.800 --> 00:20:05.640
They definitely weren't.

00:20:05.890 --> 00:20:10.010
I think someone knows about me,

00:20:10.010 --> 00:20:12.220
and they're testing my power.

00:20:13.160 --> 00:20:14.900
I can't escape that feeling.

00:20:15.190 --> 00:20:18.390
If that's the case, you'll be safer here.

00:20:18.740 --> 00:20:19.490
Yeah...

00:20:20.250 --> 00:20:22.150
But I still have to go.

00:20:22.640 --> 00:20:27.230
I don't want to make trouble for you, 
the elves, or the lizardfolk.

00:20:28.250 --> 00:20:30.660
And because I have this power,

00:20:31.100 --> 00:20:33.410
I'll be fine on my own.

00:20:34.330 --> 00:20:35.950
On your own?

00:20:35.950 --> 00:20:37.900
Who said you were going on your own?

00:20:39.490 --> 00:20:41.360
Well, it's as you said...

00:20:41.360 --> 00:20:44.340
Anyone who comes with me 
will have to deal with ogres.

00:20:44.990 --> 00:20:47.990
And I have this weird power of my own.

00:20:49.300 --> 00:20:50.690
Don't jump to conclusions.

00:20:50.690 --> 00:20:52.050
You think we're afraid of that?

00:20:52.420 --> 00:20:55.150
If you're going to go running off,

00:20:55.150 --> 00:20:57.060
we're going to go running after you.

00:20:57.060 --> 00:20:58.840
Staying with Sally!

00:20:58.840 --> 00:21:00.490
What Frau said.

00:21:00.490 --> 00:21:02.100
Have a little faith.

00:21:02.540 --> 00:21:03.570
We're companions, remember?

00:21:06.300 --> 00:21:07.820
Thank you!

00:21:10.130 --> 00:21:11.360
What about you, Carrot?

00:21:12.710 --> 00:21:14.960
I'll join you, as well.

00:21:15.210 --> 00:21:16.480
Carrot...

00:21:16.480 --> 00:21:17.460
Thank you!

00:21:18.450 --> 00:21:19.240
It's nothing.

00:21:20.290 --> 00:21:22.110
You have nice companions.

00:21:22.530 --> 00:21:24.220
Take care of them, all right?

00:21:24.600 --> 00:21:25.480
I will!

00:21:25.850 --> 00:21:27.220
Will you join us, Winnie?

00:21:27.460 --> 00:21:28.990
It looks like great fun,

00:21:29.480 --> 00:21:31.720
but this is where I belong.

00:21:31.950 --> 00:21:35.580
I'll always keep the bar open for you.

00:21:35.580 --> 00:21:36.840
Come back any time!

00:21:36.840 --> 00:21:37.700
Sure.

00:21:37.700 --> 00:21:39.260
You bet we will!

00:21:42.150 --> 00:21:44.800
Well, everyone ready to go?

00:21:44.800 --> 00:21:45.800
Yeah.

00:21:45.800 --> 00:21:46.920
Ready.

00:21:46.920 --> 00:21:48.360
Okay!

00:21:49.380 --> 00:21:50.620
Captain!

00:21:50.880 --> 00:21:52.620
Take care!

00:21:52.920 --> 00:21:56.620
Berett's not even trying to come along?

00:21:56.620 --> 00:21:59.380
Well, it's not as if he's a fighter.

00:21:59.950 --> 00:22:01.260
Well, everyone!

00:22:01.260 --> 00:22:02.880
Let's head out!

00:22:03.180 --> 00:22:03.970
Understood!

00:22:08.480 --> 00:22:09.890
Take care!

00:22:10.640 --> 00:22:12.030
See you later!
